subject: Warning about your Detag account

--- text ---
Hi,

Your Detag account received a formal warning for violating our acceptable-use policy.

Reason: repeated stock-agency template matches

This is the first step of our enforcement ladder: a further violation may lead to suspension, then termination of your account. If you believe this warning was sent in error, contact support.

— The Detag team

